      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER SPECIAL (4) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Cowboy's Rodeo (23.95) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Likely to feature again. OPAL ONYX (3) drew this same box last time when in the minors (30.13) in a OPEN over 510m at this track. Has good speed and aided by a low draw. Has the ability and looks a key chance. GREAT TERMS (1) missed the frame latest when sixth at Q Parklands (30.83) but was a winner five back in the second best time of the program. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. CODY'S STAR (7) is always a threat when he races at this track and distance.",
